ch/?api=1&amp;query=Ad%C3%BCla%20Loja%20Conceito%20Rua%20Para%C3%ADba%201441%20Belo%20Horizonte\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Abrir Adüla Loja Conceito Savassi no Google Maps\">\n        <span class=\"adula-locations__name\">Savassi</span>\n        <span class=\"adula-locations__address\">Loja Conceito<br>Belo Horizonte - MG</span>\n      </a>\n      <a class=\"adula-locations__card\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Ad%C3%BCla%20Boulevard%20Shopping%20Avenida%20dos%20Andradas%203000%20Belo%20Horizonte\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Abrir Adüla Boulevard Shopping no Google Maps\">\n        <span class=\"adula-locations__name\">Boulevard</span>\n        <span class=\"adula-locations__address\">Shopping Boulevard<br>Belo Horizonte - MG</span>\n      </a>\n      <a class=\"adula-locations__card\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Ad%C3%BCla%20P%C3%A1tio%20Savassi%20Avenida%20do%20Contorno%206061%20Belo%20Horizonte\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Abrir Adüla Pátio Savassi no Google Maps\">\n        <span class=\"adula-locations__name\">Pátio Savassi</span>\n        <span class=\"adula-locations__address\">Pátio Savassi<br>Belo Horizonte - MG</span>\n      </a>\n      <a class=\"adula-locations__card\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Ad%C3%BCla%20BH%20Shopping%20BR%20356%203049%20Belo%20Horizonte\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Abrir Adüla BH Shopping no Google Maps\">\n        <span class=\"adula-locations__name\">BH Shopping</span>\n        <span class=\"adula-locations__address\">BH Shopping<br>Belo Horizonte - MG</span>\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
      }
